# SPA fallback. Read by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages; ignored elsewhere.
#
# Routes like /services/ev-charger-installation are not files on disk — the
# router resolves them in the browser. Without this rule the host looks for a
# matching file, finds none, and returns 404 for every URL except the homepage.
#
# Other hosts need the equivalent configured on their side; see the Deployment
# section of README.md.
/*  /index.html  200
